Package: RedKinNet
Title: Selection of Unrelated Individuals from Kinship Networks
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Paolo", "Dalena", , "paolodalena97@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-2920-9572"))
Description: Selects sets of mutually unrelated individuals from pairwise
    kinship estimates. Relatedness above a user-defined threshold is
    represented as an undirected graph, and each connected component (family
    network) is resolved as a maximum independent set problem, combining
    structural rules and graph reductions with exact resolution of the
    remaining ambiguity. Ambiguous choices can be resolved at random or
    according to covariate-based criteria, and node-level diagnostics document
    the reason for every retained or discarded individual.
